            "review_title": "Review at Opus 82",
            "review_text": "OnAir38177891699\n4 contributions\n0\nA must-eat pork cutlet restaurant if you go to Ho Chi Minh City\nOct 2023 • Family\nIt is located in a good place to visit among the 7 districts of Ho Chi Minh City.\nWe sell a variety of brunch, meals, snacks, etc.\nThe best meals by far were pork cutlet and aglio olio.\nFor snacks, a delicious combination of muktae and draft beer!\nA restaurant that you will visit consistently once a week during your 3-week trip!!!\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten October 10, 2023",
