            "review_title": "Review at Opus 82",
            "review_text": "Jane Nguyen\n1 contribution\n0\nGood food should come together with good services\nApr 2019 • Family\nWe had come here many times as they serve very delicous food. But we cannot stand anymore with the attitude of the staffs. They didn't check nicely order, we had to wait very long time for our dish. It would be pleased if they said sorry, but we didn't receive any apologize from them even it was not our fault. When we paid money, I asked about the problem, one staff even didn't reply and smiled impolitdly in front of me. We end up calling the owner of the restaurant. I already introduced many of my friends to come but after this, I should think again. We pay money to eat and we deserve to have a polite serving. We don't beg for food. Even the owner said to me it was happened so many times?! then they don't do anything to improve for such a long time?! I will not come here never again and hope the restaurant will change it, especially please make the staffs at least feel responsible with their jobs- as they talk loudly and even eat during their working time.\nFarewell.\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 30, 2019",
